### Private request-tool variables: baseUrl=http://127.0.0.1:4180, sessionToken, csrfToken.
### Never save credentials here. Obtain authorized customerId before replacing order-draft.json's placeholder.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ops/v1/customers
Cookie: rf_session={{sessionToken}}

### Set createKey once per new action; reuse the original key and body for an unknown-result retry.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ops/v1/orders
Cookie: rf_session={{sessionToken}}
Origin: {{baseUrl}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{createKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

< ./order-draft.json

### Use returned order.id. Response order.version is the ETag version.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ops/v1/orders/{{orderId}}
Cookie: rf_session={{sessionToken}}

### Full OrderDraft replacement, NOT a partial JSON patch. editKey belongs to this edit only.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/ops/v1/orders/{{orderId}}
Cookie: rf_session={{sessionToken}}
Origin: {{baseUrl}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{editKey}}
If-Match: "{{orderVersion}}"
Content-Type: application/json

< ./order-draft.json

### Refresh list; pass returned nextCursor unchanged when requesting another page.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ops/v1/orders?limit=20&state=draft
Cookie: rf_session={{sessionToken}}
